<html lang='zh-TW'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>個人資料已更新</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', 'PingFang TC', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f4f6f9; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08); }
      .header { background-color: #1a365d; color: white; padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; }
      .header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; }
      .content { padding: 32px 24px; }
      .content p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
      .success { background-color: #f0fff4; border-left: 4px solid #38a169; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
      .changes { background-color: #f7f8fa; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
      .changes ul { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; }
      .changes li { margin: 4px 0; }
      .info { background-color: #ebf4ff; border-left: 4px solid #2b6cb0; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 14px; }
      .warning { background-color: #fffbeb; border-left: 4px solid #d69e2e; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 4px; }
      .warning ol { margin: 8px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; }
      .warning li { margin: 4px 0; }
      .footer { background-color: #f7f8fa; padding: 20px 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #e8ecf1; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h2>✅ 個人資料更新成功</h2>
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <p>您好，{{name}}！</p>

        <div class='success'>
          <strong>您的個人資料已成功更新</strong><br />
          您的帳號資訊已經變更。
        </div>

        {{#if changes}}
          <div class='changes'>
            <strong>變更內容：</strong>
            <ul>
              {{#each changes}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
              {{/each}}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class='info'>
          <strong>🛡️ 安全資訊：</strong><br />
          請求 IP：{{ipAddress}}<br />
          更新時間：{{timestamp}}
        </div>

        <div class='warning'>
          <strong>⚠️ 如果這不是您的操作：</strong>
          <p style='margin: 8px 0 0;'>如果您沒有進行這些變更，您的帳號可能已被入侵。請立即：</p>
          <ol>
            <li>聯絡我們的支援團隊</li>
            <li>檢查您的帳號活動</li>
            <li>變更您的密碼</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <p style='text-align: center; margin-top: 24px;'>
          <a href='{{dashboardUrl}}' style='display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; background-color: #2b6cb0; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;'>前往系統</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>為了您的帳號安全，請定期檢查您的個人資料。</p>
        <p>此郵件由系統自動發送，請勿直接回覆。</p>
        <p>&copy; 2026 加雲聯網 Intelligent Cloud Plus, Inc. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
